 "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le14ob07re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Write a dialogue between you in the present and your future self."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well that was a whirlwind vacation. I can't believe it's finished! By the time we arrive home, I'll be in the red. I will have racked up a huge bill and it'll be more than I can pay back in a couple of months! I am going to stay home and watch a lot of television. I'm not spending any money for the next little while.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It was worth it though.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It was worth every penny. What's on your agenda for the next week?", "id": 1}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm visiting my financial advisor to chat about what to do with my investments. I'm going to try some higher risk investments. By this time next week I will have changed my entire financial profile. I will also have started a new blog.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Tomorrow, I'll be yelling at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! Back to the grind! I'll be working extra hours to pay off the trip and, after a while I will start putting some away.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What are you doing with the money you save?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll invest in real estate probably. I've also begun a small retirement plan that I want to expand.", "id": 2}, {"time": "65000", "image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Retirement?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I hope I will be enjoying financial freedom at an old age.<br/>\nWe'll be sitting on benches and feeding the birds before you know it. By that point, I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry. I just like to be prepared. It's just a matter of having some restraint which I certainly did not have on our holiday!  We'd better go to bed now. Our plane leaves at 7 a.m.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Goodnight V!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Talking About the Future"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "I'll Tell You"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe situations in spoken interactions according to social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the Future Perfect tense to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I will be studying at the library at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The person will start studying at some point in the future and be studying at 4 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop studying. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span>, you can sometimes think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.  <br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for the structure of the Future Continuous and Future Perfect tenses:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">not</span>) + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span> + verb <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tomorrow I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'ll be yelling</span> at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have racked up</span> a huge bill.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will have racked up a huge bill."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Tomorrow I'll be yelling at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I\u2018ll be working extra hours to pay off the trip and, after a while I will start putting some away. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I hope I will be enjoying financial freedom at an old age."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We'll be sitting on benches and feeding the birds before you know it. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "By that point I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about schedules, you use the Simple Present. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll invest in real estate probably.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am going to stay home and watch a lot of television.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm not spending any money for the next little while.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Our plane leaves at 7 a.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be in the red"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " if you or \u200byour \u200bbank \u200baccount are in the red, you \u200bowe \u200bmoney to the \u200bbank"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: By the time we arrive home I'll be in the red."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about money."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rack up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get a large number or amount of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will have racked up a huge bill."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be worth it"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used for saying that there is a good enough reason for doing something, because it is important, enjoyable or useful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was worth it, though."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "agenda"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "all the things that need to be done in a particular time period"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What's on your agenda for the next week?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "financial profile"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a description of a person, group, or organization that contains all their money details "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: By this time next week I will have changed my entire financial profile."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "back to the grind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go back to the job at hand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Back to the grind! I\u2018ll be working extra hours to pay off the trip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "retirement"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the time (particularly in old age) after you stop working"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm excited to have more time to myself after my retirement."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nest egg"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an amount of money that is saved over a long period of time to pay for something in the future"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: By that point I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "restraint"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a way of limiting, controlling, or stopping something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's just a matter of having some restraint."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le14ob07aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Describe yourself as twenty to forty years older than you are now."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between yourself now and your future self."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make your present self ask your future self questions about life in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I tell someone about how I imagine myself in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le14ob07re1img01.jpg"}]}